      "text": "Ids from the briefing or a cited T12 / M3 can go straight to mem_get.\nThe briefing prints (+N tok): what opening an entry would cost.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Ids from the briefing or a cited T12 / M3 can go straight to mem_get.\nThe briefing prints (+N tok): what opening an entry would cost.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
